"There is a daimyou nearby whose heir is looking for marriage. This daimyou\'s clan holds some guarded secrets, so it would be good to claim this marriage for your clan. Find Heian-style paper fans, and wave them in the house of the heir to make your proposal.",
 "A rival clan has been secretly conducting trade with foreigners, and has amassed a large supply of weapons in a large castle in a nearby district. You must take this castle and its resources for your clan!",
"Pirates have captured the children of important samurai in your army. You must rescue them quickly, not only to keep them alive, but so that news does not spread; your parents may well feel dishonored enough to commit suicide if it seems their line has failed!",
"An enemy daimyou has hired a shinobi clan to train more shinobi for them. If you can find the camps of this clan, you can confiscate their weapons and writings.",
"An enemy daimyou has hired a spy, disguised as a member of your army! Your scouts have managed to copy the sigil of the daimyou\'s lanterns, so that when you find the spy, you can give them the lantern to force them to reveal themselves."
};
 int q=-1;
 for(uint ik=0; ik<quests.length(); ik++) {if(quest==quests[ik]) q=ik;}
 switch (q) {
 case 0 : {
 // Shogun with three daimyou.
